# 15. Data Storage

The initial system should preserve several classes of data.

```text
Raw telemetry
Normalized events
Features
Labels
Model predictions
Decisions
Investigations
Ground truth
Experiment metadata
```

Suggested initial storage:

```text
local files
    +
SQLite / PostgreSQL
```

A relational database becomes more useful as the dataset grows.

